abstract: "Exact integer certificates excluding 275-point caps in AG(7,3), using explicit low-dimensional classification and completion premises. Includes the complete eight-branch minimum-direction proof, preserved source dependencies, independent verification evidence, and a 236-point cap. The final certificate is checked on 8,807,118 raw matrix rows and 15,885 finite-support evaluations; earlier certificate replays and published classification completeness remain inherited premises. Earlier upper-275 and upper-279 releases are preserved. AI assistance and shared dependencies are disclosed in README.md."
